【构图方式】F-A：左十二、主六十五、右十八五格。\n【输出规格】二比三竖版F-A；一次性成型；禁三视八宫。\n【风格参考】竖屏古风仿真人精致脸瓷感柔肤梦幻唯美无漫画脸无字幕。\n照片级材质光影、物理可信结构。\n【光影效果】柔和主光从侧前方照在脸上，皮肤细腻干净。画面带薄薄雾气。侧后方淡淡轮廓光勾出发丝、肩线和纱衣边缘。背景暖色宫灯虚化光斑，前景轻微虚化纱幔或柳枝。人物最清晰，远处渐朦胧。\n【质感细节】竹篮纤维、丝绦光泽、琉璃耳坠高光、肤面柔和。\n【工程/材质参数】单Look；五表情同脸同妆。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [73], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["光影古风 (2).safetensors", 0.6500000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 60, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [3545.921875, 854.025146484375], "id": 52, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [74], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["软萌可爱，古风BJD-古风短剧厚涂女孩_v1.safetensors", 0.7000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 73, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [3542.900634765625, 995.408447265625], "id": 71,